# Wave 112 Ship 2AA-debug 2026-05-09 — exclude HOME-redirect Windows-conventional paths
# Per CLAUDE.local.md ENV (a): USERPROFILE=Z:\claude-sota-installed (HOME redirect for portable runtime)
# Side-effect: Windows apps create AppData/ + .ssh/ + .cache/ etc subdirs under redirected HOME
# These are NOT eee runtime content; gitnexus analyze . was walking them and bailing silently
# Fix per gitnexus README: .gitnexusignore supports .gitignore-style patterns
# Cite: https://github.com/abhigyanpatwari/GitNexus README "Tip: .gitnexusignore supports .gitignore-style negation"

# HOME-redirect Windows-conventional dirs (NOT eee runtime content)
AppData/
.bun/
.ccs/
.cache/
.ssh/
.npm/
.vscode/
.docker/
.nuget/

# Other system-class directories that shouldn't be indexed
.local/
.cargo/
.gitnexus/

# Plugin caches (already in .gitignore but explicit for gitnexus)
.claude/plugins/cache/
.claude/plugins/marketplaces/
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/state/
.claude/projects/
.claude/sessions/

